    "summary": "A man&#039;s hat, so-called &#039;four-winds&#039;, trimmed with fur.  Four large blue points stitched to a base with brown fur trim (cream fur at edge).  Blue fabric made of commercially woven wool cloth.  A strip of red wool cloth included in seam securing two sections together.  Lined with blue tabby woven cotton cloth.  Many red braided loops stitched in a vertical line centre back of base.  Stuffed with feathers.",
